WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.473 --> 00:00:03.890
- Wow, you don't seem like an only child.

00:00:06.411 --> 00:00:07.722
- I never would have guessed,

00:00:07.722 --> 00:00:10.145
you're just so good about sharing food.

00:00:10.145 --> 00:00:11.816
- I have to get my niece
something for her birthday.

00:00:11.816 --> 00:00:14.716
She's an only child, I can't
get her a board game, right?

00:00:14.716 --> 00:00:16.136
Who's she gonna play with?

00:00:16.136 --> 00:00:18.912
- That explains why you have
such an active imagination.

00:00:18.912 --> 00:00:20.865
- You must love being alone.

00:00:20.865 --> 00:00:22.866
- You must love being around people.

00:00:22.866 --> 00:00:24.335
- Your parents must have treated you

00:00:24.335 --> 00:00:26.457
like the center of the universe.

00:00:26.457 --> 00:00:27.493
- Was it hard making friends?

00:00:27.493 --> 00:00:29.278
- I bet you had a lot
of imaginary friends.

00:00:29.278 --> 00:00:31.594
- Oh you're an only child?

00:00:31.594 --> 00:00:33.320
That makes a lot of sense.

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:34.881
- You must be really
close with your parents,

00:00:34.881 --> 00:00:37.027
like you're best friends, right?

00:00:37.027 --> 00:00:38.791
- Didn't you wish you
had a sibling growing up?

00:00:38.791 --> 00:00:41.102
- Why didn't your parents
want any more kids

00:00:41.102 --> 00:00:43.530
or oh, is that too personal?

00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:44.750
- You're one of the good ones.

00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:47.240
- What's wrong with your parents?

00:00:47.240 --> 00:00:49.252
Or is that too personal?

00:00:49.252 --> 00:00:50.610
- You're so lucky you never had to share.

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:52.378
- I wish I was an only child.

00:00:52.378 --> 00:00:53.876
- You're not even self-centered.

00:00:53.876 --> 00:00:54.999
- Were you lonely?

00:00:54.999 --> 00:00:56.683
- You're gonna have to
take care of your parents

00:00:56.683 --> 00:00:59.864
all by yourself when you get older.

00:00:59.864 --> 00:01:02.036
That's gonna be really tough.

00:01:02.036 --> 00:01:03.470
- I bet you talk to yourself a lot.

00:01:03.470 --> 00:01:05.337
- You just seem so well-adjusted.

00:01:05.337 --> 00:01:08.389
- Oh but you at least you
get all the best gifts

00:01:08.389 --> 00:01:10.389
at Christmastime, right?

00:01:11.247 --> 00:01:15.250
Only children are the devil's children.

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:17.137
It's true though.

00:01:17.137 --> 00:01:19.720
(upbeat music)

